    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Rathfarnham are delighted to present to the market 11 Kingston Court, Rathfarnham, Dublin 16, D16YP97.\n\nSituated just off Taylors Lane, just a short stroll from St. Enda's Park, this attractive, “B3” Rated, two-bedroom mid-terrace home comes to the market in excellent turnkey condition. Thoughtfully upgraded and modernised by the current owners in recent years, the property offers stylish, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, along with a very private south-facing rear garden. Located in this well-established area in Rathfarnham, this charming home is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers looking to settle in a mature and highly desirable residential setting.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a kitchen/breakfast room, a living/dining room to the rear overlooking the rear garden. Upstairs comprises a landing, two double bedrooms and a family bathroom. \n\nTo the front is a paved driveway providing off street parking while to the rear is beautifully landscaped south facing garden, set in lawn with a patio area the ideal space to enjoy the sun all day and into the late evening. \n\nVery popular with families, Kingston Court is located just a short stroll from both St. Enda's Park and Marlay Park. Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre are all within a short commute and the property is within the catchment area for some of south Dublin's most highly regarded primary & secondary schools. There are numerous bus routes on your doorstep providing easy access to the city centre and beyond and it is less than one mile from the M50 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.35m x 1.74m\nWith stylish floor tiling and integrated understairs storage\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 3.35m x 2.82m\nFully fitted kitchen with timber counter tops and tiled floor & tiled surround\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.36m x 4.65m\nOpen fireplace with granite hearth; built-in shelving; overlooks rear garden\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 5.21m x 1.70m\nWith Stira to attic\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.36m x 2.86m\nVery spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 2.86m\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.50m x 1.70m\nHigh quality bathroom suite with WC, WHB & bath with electric shower; fully tiled; heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Attractive two-bedroom property</li><li> Turnkey condition - Modernised in recent years.</li><li> South facing rear garden.</li><li> Energy efficient property “B3” BER Rating</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Cul-de-sac location</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Short walk to both St. Enda's Park and Marlay Park</li><li> Short drive to M50</ul>"
      },
